  "body": "Hi guys,\r\n\r\nI was looking into #1490 and tried to add a new step to the [\"Constructing the form data set\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#constructing-form-data-set) algorithm\r\n\r\n@domenic please let me know if I get correctly what you meant here\r\n> A fix for this would be to add an additional step, after \"End:\", which is similar to the previous CRLF one. The exception for this step is only values when the type is \"file\". The action is to replace the value or name by the result of converting to a sequence of Unicode scalar values.\r\n\r\nThank you \r\n",
